    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d489-a1">

                <pb facs="0850" n="754" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg754"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Rear-Admiral Reynolds to Mr. Cadwalader.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Navy Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 5, 1874</date>.
                        (Received Aug. 6.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department has received from
                    Lieutenant-Commander F. M. Green, commanding the steamer Fortune, lately engaged
                    in surveying the coast of Mexico, a <pb facs="0851" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>
                    report, copy of which is inclosed, in which he calls attention to the valuable
                    assistance rendered in the prosecution of his work by the Hon. J. W. Foster,
                    United States minister to Mexico, and by General Mejia, the minister of war and
                    marine of Mexico.</p>
                <p>The Department desires to express its appreciation of the services of these
                    gentlemen, and requests that its thanks may be conveyed to them through the
                    Department of State.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed>WM. REYNOLDS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of the
                            Navy.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">John L. Cadwalader</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
